      "statement": "For the primary fixed-geometry wB97M-V/def2-TZVP/SMD(DCM) comparison, (RRRR)-MM is lower in electronic energy than (SSSS)-MM, consistent with SI Fig.S10 (source difference -6.56 kJ/mol). Judge labels, signed difference and convergence together. Other methods are sensitivity evidence, not replacements for the primary ordering. Bounded failure does not establish the ordering."
